== Effects ==
* Has a 25% chance to grant the effects of a random passive [[Item Tags mom#Passive Collectibles|Mom item]] each room.

== Notes ==
* The trinket can't give the effect of {{i|Mom's Coin Purse}} or {{i|Mom's Purse}}.
* The trinket can give the effect of a Mom item Isaac already has.
* Mom's Lock doesn't count towards {{tf|Yes Mother?}}, no matter the effect.
* The items chosen by the trinket won't grant [[health]] or spawn [[pickup]]s/consumables.

== Synergies ==
* {{a|Golden Trinket}} / {{i|Mom's Box}}: Each copy increases the chance for activation to 50%, further copies to 100%.

== Bugs ==
{{bug|dlc=nr+|Mom's Lock will not contribute to the Yes Mother? transformation nor unlocking {{i|Mom's Contacts}} despite having the item tag.}}

